  "prompts": {
    "image": "Create the AMBER award companion frame to image 1. Image 1 defines only the exact 16:9 landscape composition, camera, seamless off-white studio backdrop, floor and negative space. Replace the golden smile sculpture completely with the AMBER sculpture from image 2, which is the binding object reference: a tall rounded pointed lozenge/flame-shaped loop of thick translucent orange amber with a large tapered hollow center, softly twisted beveled surfaces, internal natural amber flecks. Preserve that unique silhouette, don't invent an emoji face or cradle. Position the entire amber sculpture on the same left-side floor area, center x=28%, bottom y=86%, top y=15%, entirely within left 47% of frame. Same near-frontal long-lens product camera as first reference. Realistic warm amber refraction and soft warm glow near its edges, delicate contact shadow. Clean near-white blank right half. No plinth, no black stand, no text, no people, no curtains, no particles, no moving elements. Match image 1's restrained luxury product photography. Opaque background, 1920x1080 landscape composition.",
    "endFrameDescription": "Identyczny kadr końcowy. Kamera i bryła bez zmian; planowana zmiana poświaty wyłącznie wewnątrz przyszłej animacji.",
